<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="ST">
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[// AOI 名称: OreProdStats_3Shift_No2H (三班制产量统计系统 - 无2小时分段)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[// 版本: 1.0]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="3">
<![CDATA[// 编程语言: Structured Text (ST)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="4">
<![CDATA[// 适用平台: Studio 5000 (ControlLogix/CompactLogix)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[// 功能概述:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="7">
<![CDATA[// 1. 在保留原 OreProdStats AOI 功能(总/分钟/天/月统计)的基础上,实现固定时间的三班制产量统计,去除每2小时的单独累计;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="8">
<![CDATA[// 2. 三个班次的时间范围固定如下:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="9">
<![CDATA[//    - 早班: 09:00 – 17:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="10">
<![CDATA[//    - 中班: 17:00 – 次日 01:00 (跨越午夜)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="11">
<![CDATA[//    - 晚班: 01:00 – 09:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="12">
<![CDATA[// 3. 每个班次提供:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="13">
<![CDATA[//    - 班实时累计: 当前正在运行班次在本班周期内的实时总产量;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="14">
<![CDATA[//    - 班历史累计: 上一次完成的该班的总产量(在班切换时冻结);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="15">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="16">
<![CDATA[// 设计说明:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="17">
<![CDATA[// 1. 时间基准:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="18">
<![CDATA[//    - 使用系统时间 Year/Month/Day/Hour/Minute/Second;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="19">
<![CDATA[//    - 计算 Time_Real = Hour * 60 + Minute (范围 0..1439),作为一天内统一的“分钟计数”时间轴。]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="20">
<![CDATA[// 2. 班次判定:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="21">
<![CDATA[//    - 班次通过比较 Time_Real 与三个固定时间点(9:00、17:00、1:00)自动判定,跨午夜的情况单独处理;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="22">
<![CDATA[//    - Shift_ID = 1: 早班  09:00–17:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="23">
<![CDATA[//    - Shift_ID = 2: 中班  17:00–次日 01:00 (跨午夜)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="24">
<![CDATA[//    - Shift_ID = 3: 晚班  01:00–09:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="25">
<![CDATA[// 3. 累计策略:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="26">
<![CDATA[//    - 以 OSRI 检测到的脉冲上升沿为触发,在对应班次的临时变量上累加产量;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="27">
<![CDATA[//    - 在班切换时,将本班临时累计拷贝到历史班累计输出,随后清零临时值;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="28">
<![CDATA[//    - 班切换时间固定: 早班结束=中班开始(17:00),中班结束=晚班开始(01:00),晚班结束=早班开始(09:00)。]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="29">
<![CDATA[// 4. 与原 AOI 的兼容:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="30">
<![CDATA[//    - 总累计/分钟累计/天累计/月累计逻辑完全沿用原 OreProdStats 程序,保证统计口径一致;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="31">
<![CDATA[//    - 原 AOI 中与班次相关的时间输入(In_Class1/2_Time_*)仍被保留,用于天/月切换等场景。]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="32">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="33">
<![CDATA[// 变量约定(相对原 OreProdStats 的扩展部分):]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="34">
<![CDATA[// 1. 输出(历史班累计):]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="35">
<![CDATA[//    - Out_Tot_Shift1, Out_Tot_Shift2, Out_Tot_Shift3 : DINT;   // 分别表示早/中/晚班上一个完成班次的总产量]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="36">
<![CDATA[// 2. 输出(实时班累计):]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="37">
<![CDATA[//    - Out_Tot_Shift1_RT, Out_Tot_Shift2_RT, Out_Tot_Shift3_RT : DINT; // 各自班当前周期内的实时累计]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="38">
<![CDATA[//    - Out_Tot_Shift_RT : DINT;                                        // 当前班的实时累计(根据 Shift_ID 选取)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="39">
<![CDATA[// 3. 本地变量(班临时累计):]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="40">
<![CDATA[//    - TempShift1, TempShift2, TempShift3 : DINT;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="41">
<![CDATA[//      用于在当前班周期内累加产量,在班结束时拷贝到 Out_Tot_ShiftX 并清零。]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="42">
<![CDATA[// 4. 本地变量(班次辅助):]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="43">
<![CDATA[//    - Shift_ID : DINT;  // 当前班号(1=早班, 2=中班, 3=晚班)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="44">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="45">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="46">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="47">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 1: 脉冲检测与总累计]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="48">
<![CDATA[// 与原 OreProdStats 相同]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="49">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="50">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="51">
<![CDATA[// 脉冲上升沿检测]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="52">
<![CDATA[OSRI_Pulse.InputBit := In_Pulse;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="53">
<![CDATA[OSRI(OSRI_Pulse);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="54">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="55">
<![CDATA[// 总累计计数]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="56">
<![CDATA[IF OSRI_Pulse.OutputBit AND In_Run THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="57">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot := Out_Tot + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="58">
<![CDATA[    Temp[0] := Temp[0] + In_Scale;   // 分钟累计临时量]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="59">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="60">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="61">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="62">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 2: 分钟累计]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="63">
<![CDATA[// 与原 OreProdStats 相同]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="64">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="65">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="66">
<![CDATA[TONR_01.PRE := In_Tot_Min * 60000;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="67">
<![CDATA[TONR_01.Reset := TONR_01.DN;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="68">
<![CDATA[TONR_01.TimerEnable := In_Run;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="69">
<![CDATA[TONR(TONR_01);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="70">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="71">
<![CDATA[IF TONR_01.DN THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="72">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Min := Temp[0];]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="73">
<![CDATA[    Temp[0] := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="74">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="75">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="76">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="77">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 3: 时间数据准备]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="78">
<![CDATA[// 与原 OreProdStats 相同,并在此基础上增加三班制辅助变量]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="79">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="80">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="81">
<![CDATA[// 系统时间 -> 数组]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="82">
<![CDATA[Time[0] := Year;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="83">
<![CDATA[Time[1] := Month;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="84">
<![CDATA[Time[2] := Day;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="85">
<![CDATA[Time[3] := Hour;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="86">
<![CDATA[Time[4] := Minute;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="87">
<![CDATA[Time[5] := Second;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="88">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="89">
<![CDATA[// 当前时间的分钟偏移量 (0..1439)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="90">
<![CDATA[Time_Real := Hour * 60 + Minute;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="91">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="92">
<![CDATA[// 原班次/天切换时间计算(保留天/月逻辑需要)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="93">
<![CDATA[Time_Set1 := In_Class1_Time_Hour * 60 + In_Class1_Time_Minute;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="94">
<![CDATA[Time_Set2 := In_Class2_Time_Hour * 60 + In_Class2_Time_Minute;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="95">
<![CDATA[Time_Set3_Day := In_Day_Time_Hour * 60 + In_Day_Time_Minute;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="96">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="97">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="98">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 4: 三班制班次判定]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="99">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="100">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="101">
<![CDATA[// 班次判定:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="102">
<![CDATA[// Shift_ID = 1: 早班  09:00–17:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="103">
<![CDATA[// Shift_ID = 2: 中班  17:00–次日 01:00 (跨午夜)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="104">
<![CDATA[// Shift_ID = 3: 晚班  01:00–09:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="105">
<![CDATA[IF (Time_Real >= 9 * 60) AND (Time_Real < 17 * 60) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="106">
<![CDATA[    Shift_ID := 1;  // 早班]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="107">
<![CDATA[ELSIF (Time_Real >= 17 * 60) OR (Time_Real < 1 * 60) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="108">
<![CDATA[    Shift_ID := 2;  // 中班(跨午夜)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="109">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="110">
<![CDATA[    Shift_ID := 3;  // 晚班]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="111">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="112">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="113">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="114">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 5: 三班制班累计]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="115">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="116">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="117">
<![CDATA[// 在脉冲处进行三班累计]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="118">
<![CDATA[IF OSRI_Pulse.OutputBit AND In_Run THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="119">
<![CDATA[    // 班累计临时值]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="120">
<![CDATA[    CASE Shift_ID OF]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="121">
<![CDATA[        1:  TempShift1 := TempShift1 + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="122">
<![CDATA[        2:  TempShift2 := TempShift2 + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="123">
<![CDATA[        3:  TempShift3 := TempShift3 + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="124">
<![CDATA[    END_CASE;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="125">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="126">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="127">
<![CDATA[// 班实时累计输出]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="128">
<![CDATA[Out_Tot_Shift1_RT := TempShift1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="129">
<![CDATA[Out_Tot_Shift2_RT := TempShift2;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="130">
<![CDATA[Out_Tot_Shift3_RT := TempShift3;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="131">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="132">
<![CDATA[// 当前班实时累计(用于 HMI 显示“当前班产量”)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="133">
<![CDATA[CASE Shift_ID OF]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="134">
<![CDATA[    1: Out_Tot_Shift_RT := Out_Tot_Shift1_RT;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="135">
<![CDATA[    2: Out_Tot_Shift_RT := Out_Tot_Shift2_RT;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="136">
<![CDATA[    3: Out_Tot_Shift_RT := Out_Tot_Shift3_RT;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="137">
<![CDATA[END_CASE;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="138">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="139">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="140">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 6: 班结束时保存班累计并清零]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="141">
<![CDATA[// 班切换时间固定:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="142">
<![CDATA[//   早班结束=中班开始: 17:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="143">
<![CDATA[//   中班结束=晚班开始: 01:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="144">
<![CDATA[//   晚班结束=早班开始: 09:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="145">
<![CDATA[// 逻辑与原白/夜班逻辑类似,先冻结历史值,再延迟 2 秒清零临时量]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="146">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="147">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="148">
<![CDATA[// 早班结束 / 中班开始: 17:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="149">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 17) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second <= 1) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="150">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift1 := TempShift1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="151">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift1_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="152">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="153">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="154">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 17) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second >= 2) AND (Second <= 3) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="155">
<![CDATA[    TempShift1 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="156">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="157">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="158">
<![CDATA[// 中班结束 / 晚班开始: 01:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="159">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 1) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second <= 1) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="160">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift2 := TempShift2;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="161">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift2_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="162">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="163">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="164">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 1) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second >= 2) AND (Second <= 3) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="165">
<![CDATA[    TempShift2 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="166">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="167">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="168">
<![CDATA[// 晚班结束 / 早班开始: 09:00]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="169">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 9) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second <= 1) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="170">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift3 := TempShift3;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="171">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift3_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="172">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="173">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="174">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = 9) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second >= 2) AND (Second <= 3) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="175">
<![CDATA[    TempShift3 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="176">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="177">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="178">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="179">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 7: 天累计逻辑]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="180">
<![CDATA[// 直接复用原 OreProdStats 的实现]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="181">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="182">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="183">
<![CDATA[IF OSRI_Pulse.OutputBit AND In_Run THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="184">
<![CDATA[    Temp[8] := Temp[8] + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="185">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="186">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="187">
<![CDATA[Out_Tot_D_RT := Temp[8];]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="188">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="189">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = In_Day_Time_Hour) AND (Minute = In_Day_Time_Minute) AND (Second <= 1) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="190">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_D := Temp[8];]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="191">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_D_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="192">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="193">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="194">
<![CDATA[IF (Hour = In_Day_Time_Hour) AND (Minute = In_Day_Time_Minute) AND (Second >= 2) AND (Second <= 3) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="195">
<![CDATA[    Temp[8] := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="196">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="197">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="198">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="199">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 8: 月累计逻辑(与原 OreProdStats 相同)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="200">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="201">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="202">
<![CDATA[Is_Leap_Year := (Year MOD 4 = 0) AND (Year MOD 100 <> 0) OR (Year MOD 400 = 0);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="203">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="204">
<![CDATA[CASE Month OF]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="205">
<![CDATA[    1, 3, 5, 7, 8, 10, 12: Days_In_Month := 31;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="206">
<![CDATA[    4, 6, 9, 11: Days_In_Month := 30;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="207">
<![CDATA[    2:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="208">
<![CDATA[        IF Is_Leap_Year THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="209">
<![CDATA[            Days_In_Month := 29;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="210">
<![CDATA[        ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="211">
<![CDATA[            Days_In_Month := 28;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="212">
<![CDATA[        END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="213">
<![CDATA[END_CASE;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="214">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="215">
<![CDATA[IF (Day >= 1) AND (Day <= Days_In_Month) AND OSRI_Pulse.OutputBit AND In_Run THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="216">
<![CDATA[    Temp[4] := Temp[4] + In_Scale;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="217">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="218">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="219">
<![CDATA[IF (Day >= 1) AND (Day <= Days_In_Month) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="220">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_M_RT := Temp[4];]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="221">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="222">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="223">
<![CDATA[IF (Day = 1) AND (Hour = 0) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second <= 1) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="224">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_M := Temp[4];]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="225">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_M_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="226">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="227">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="228">
<![CDATA[IF (Day = 1) AND (Hour = 0) AND (Minute = 0) AND (Second >= 2) AND (Second <= 3) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="229">
<![CDATA[    Temp[4] := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="230">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="231">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="232">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="233">
<![CDATA[// 功能段 9: HMI 命令处理(三班累计)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="234">
<![CDATA[// ===============================================================]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="235">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="236">
<![CDATA[IF HMI_CMD.Clear THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="237">
<![CDATA[    // 清零原有输出累计值]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="238">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="239">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Min := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="240">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_D_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="241">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_M_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="242">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_D := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="243">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_M := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="244">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="245">
<![CDATA[    // 清零三班累计(历史与实时)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="246">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift1 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="247">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift2 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="248">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift3 := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="249">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="250">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift1_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="251">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift2_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="252">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift3_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="253">
<![CDATA[    Out_Tot_Shift_RT := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="254">
<![CDATA[]]>
